---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Work | Mohamed Meghawry"
  description="Desktop and endpoint support at LifeLabs, technical support and an iOS/Android app at the Canadian Arabic Orchestra, and IT support at York University."
>
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Work</h1>

  <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600">Endpoint support, IT support, and automation.</p>

  <section class="mt-12 space-y-12">
    <article>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">
        Desktop Analyst (Contract)
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-500">LifeLabs · Jun 2026 to present</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-gray-700 list-disc list-inside">
        <li>Remediate Windows endpoint vulnerabilities in a PHIPA-regulated healthcare environment.</li>
        <li>Deploy patches and configuration fixes to managed devices.</li>
        <li>Upgrade workstations and laptops to Windows 11 and provide deskside support.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">
        Technical Support Engineer
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-500">The Canadian Arabic Orchestra · Jul 2023 to Jun 2026</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-gray-700 list-disc list-inside">
        <li>Maintained up to 8 WordPress sites with backups and plugin updates, and cut median page load time 45%.</li>
        <li>Built and launched the orchestra's iOS and Android app, Maple Arts, now live on the <a href="https://apps.apple.com/ca/app/maple-arts/id6769157144" class="underline hover:text-gray-500">App Store</a> and <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=co.maplearts.app" class="underline hover:text-gray-500">Google Play</a>.</li>
        <li>Automated 80% of WhatsApp customer inquiries with Make.com and cut response time to under 60 seconds.</li>
        <li>Provided front-line support by phone, email, and WhatsApp.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">
        Technical Support Specialist
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-500">Lassonde School of Engineering, York University · May 2022 to Jun 2023</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-gray-700 list-disc list-inside">
        <li>Resolved student and faculty tickets across Windows, macOS, and Linux labs, prioritizing by severity.</li>
        <li>Provided technical support and mentorship to over 100 Computer Science students.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">
        Help Desk Specialist
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-500">York University · Jan 2022 to May 2022</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-gray-700 list-disc list-inside">
        <li>Diagnosed and resolved hardware, software, and network issues in person and remotely.</li>
        <li>Managed accounts and access via Active Directory and university identity systems.</li>
        <li>Supported Windows and macOS environments end to end, including imaging.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </section>
</Layout>
